# VoltShare Frontend Environment Variables
#
# VoltShare automatically detects:
# - Metro tunnel proxy when running 'npm run tunnel' (expo start --tunnel)
# - Local LAN IP when running Expo Go on the same Wi-Fi network
# - Localhost when running in web browser or simulators
#
# Only uncomment and set if you want to explicitly override the backend URL:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
